Package: com.puccy.app
Name: Puccy
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Rootless IPA installer & app manager for modern jailbreaks.
 Permanently install IPAs, manage apps, inject tweaks with ElleKit.
 Supports Dopamine & palera1n rootless environments.
Maintainer: Puccy Dev <puccy@jb.dev>
Author: Puccy Dev
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), ellekit
